<li>Tony Banks – piano, organ, piano elektrik, mellotron, synthesizer, backing vocals, gitar 12 senar di lagu "The Cinema Show"</li>
<li>Phil Collins – drum, perkusi, backing vocals, vokal utama di lagu "More Fool Me"</li>
<li>Peter Gabriel – vokal utama, flute, oboe, perkusi</li>
<li>Steve Hackett – gitar utama</li>
<li>Mike Rutherford – bass, bass pedal, gitar rythm, sitar elektrik, gitar 12 senar di lagu "The Cinema Show" dan "More Fool Me", backing vocal</li>
</ul>

